# Two substantial endings selected by the demo's single dynamic reference.

label ending_bright:
    scene library night with fade
    show renpy bright at center
    stop music fadeout 1.0

    r "Morning enters the library one shelf at a time, careful not to wake the unfinished books."
    r "RenPy Mouse pins the polished page beside the eastern window where everyone can read it."
    r "The dialogue catches the new light and still sounds honest."
    r "The pauses remain exactly where they were, holding rain and laughter between the words."
    r "Even the proud brass bookmark admits that one finished scene beats twelve hurried routes."
    r "The library files the page under stories that know when to linger."
    r "RenPy Mouse finally eats the repair cake, which has survived without demanding a subplot."
    r "Outside, the day begins with no arrows at all and a very promising first sentence."
    return

label ending_quiet:
    scene clock basement with fade
    show renpy thinking at center
    stop music fadeout 1.0

    r "Before dawn, RenPy Mouse carries the finished page down to the sleeping clock."
    r "He reads it once in the dark, where only the dialogue and the softest sounds remain."
    r "The clock misses a tick on purpose so the farewell has room to settle."
    r "Nothing flashes, branches, or asks to be solved before morning."
    r "The library above them exhales through a thousand paper leaves."
    r "RenPy Mouse closes the editor with the calm click of a story keeping its promise."
    r "He leaves the page on the workbench beside the tiny screwdriver and the untouched crumb."
    r "In the quiet, one scene becomes large enough to contain the whole night."
    return
